The file names, product names, services, installation paths, log files, domains and
ports in catalog.json come from the LOLRMM catalogue (https://lolrmm.io/api/rmm_tools.json),
filtered and merged by tools/make_catalog.py. The list of programs and the code-signing
company names were chosen and checked by hand.

